                <head>393. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On March 13, Ambassador Beaulac and
                    Chilean Minister for Foreign Affairs Enrique O.
                        Barbosa Baeza signed a new Public Law 480 agreement in Santiago. The agreement, which entered into
                    force on June 2, provided for the sale of United States agricultural commodities
                    to Chile valued at approximately $34.6 million. For text, see 7 UST 1007.</p>
            </div>
